---
import Platform from '../layouts/Platform.astro';
import { COMMENTER_POINTS_LABEL } from '../data/ranking-copy.mjs';
---
<Platform title="Weekly winners" description="The top three Digivated launches of every week, and how the weekly launch ranking works." canonicalPath="/winners">
  <div class="dg-winners">
    <header class="dg-winners-head">
      <p class="dg-winners-label"><span aria-hidden="true">[</span> ★ Weekly podium <span aria-hidden="true">]</span></p>
      <h1>Weekly winners</h1>
      <p>Each Monday, last week’s top three land here, with a badge for their site.</p>
    </header>
    <p class="dg-forum-status" data-winners-status role="status">Loading winners…</p>
    <ol class="dg-weeks" data-weeks></ol>
    <button type="button" class="dg-more" data-winners-more hidden>Show earlier weeks</button>

    <section id="how-ranking-works" class="dg-how" aria-labelledby="dg-how-title">
      <h2 id="dg-how-title"><span aria-hidden="true">[</span> How ranking works <span aria-hidden="true">]</span></h2>
      <dl class="dg-how-list">
        <div><dt><span aria-hidden="true">▲</span> Upvotes, weighted by trust</dt><dd>Every upvote counts. Signed-in members count more, and regulars who join discussions count the most.</dd></div>
        <div><dt><span aria-hidden="true">#</span> Real conversation</dt><dd>Each member who comments adds {COMMENTER_POINTS_LABEL}. The maker’s own comments don’t count.</dd></div>
        <div><dt><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span> Feedback points</dt><dd>Give useful feedback, earn points. Every 10 points adds an upvote to your own launch.</dd></div>
        <div><dt><span aria-hidden="true">~</span> A fair start</dt><dd>Until Tuesday 14:00 UTC, the order shuffles and counts stay hidden. No early rush wins it.</dd></div>
        <div><dt><span aria-hidden="true">$</span> Money never buys rank</dt><dd>Member and paid spots sit in the side rails, clearly labeled. They never change a launch score.</dd></div>
        <div><dt><span aria-hidden="true">★</span> The podium</dt><dd>Weeks run Monday to Sunday (UTC). On Monday the top three make the podium and get an award badge.</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <p class="dg-how-foot"><a class="dg-btn dg-btn-primary" href="/submit-project">Launch your project</a> <a class="dg-quiet-link" href="/#this-week">See this week’s launches →</a></p>
    </section>
  </div>
  <script>import '../scripts/winners.js';</script>
</Platform>
